# ==============================================================
# Naukri Auto-Apply Bot - How To Run (Unified Single Command)
# ==============================================================

Sirf ek hi command chalana hai:

python Naukri-Edge.py

# Yeh command kya karega:
# 1. Aapke .env preferences (KEYWORDS, LOCATION=remote, etc.) ke mutabiq jobs khojega.
# 2. Bekar / irrelevant jobs (Java, Spring Boot, ERP, .NET, Architect, over-experience) ko automatically skip karega.
# 3. Direct Naukri 1-click jobs ko automatically apply karega.
# 4. Recruiter chatbot / questionnaire aane par Gemini AI aur aapki CV context se auto-answer karke apply karega.
# 5. 'Apply on company site' aane par company ki real website career URL extract karega.
# 6. Sirf 2 clean CSV files maintain karega:
#    - applied_jobs.csv       (Safal applications ki report)
#    - manual_apply_jobs.csv  (Company site URL ke saath manual apply aur failed jobs)
